  "interpretation": [
    "The teacher is not uniformly weak: 75.9% of rows have the best positive above the max negative, and teacher margin correlates strongly with BGE-M3 hybrid margin.",
    "The pair-level distribution is too easy/top-heavy for distillation: 19,671 of 27,960 negative pairs are in the 4_plus margin bin, while middle-score negatives are much less common.",
